  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Smart Card — URL",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "URL을 favicon + host + path 로 미리보는 시그니처 카드.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"URL 항목, 클릭하여 복사\"><header class=\"ds-card-head\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-url\">URL</span><time class=\"ds-card-date\">3분 전</time><button class=\"ds-card-delete\" aria-label=\"삭제\">×</button></header><div class=\"ds-card-row\"><img class=\"ds-favicon\" src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=32&domain=linear.app\" alt=\"\" /><div class=\"ds-stack\"><div class=\"ds-strong\">linear.app</div><div class=\"ds-muted\">https://linear.app/changelog</div></div></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),border-color .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);outline:none;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;color:#111827}.ds-card:hover,.ds-card:focus-visible{border-color:#4f46e5;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -4px rgba(79,70,229,.25);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-badge{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px}.ds-badge-url{background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8}.ds-card-date{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:#6b7280}.ds-card-delete{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:transparent;color:#6b7280;font-size:16px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;transition:all .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-card:hover .ds-card-delete{opacity:1}.ds-card-delete:hover{background:#ef4444;color:#fff;transform:rotate(90deg)}.ds-card-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13px}.ds-favicon{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0;background:#f3f4f6}.ds-stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0;flex:1}.ds-strong{font-weight:600;word-break:break-all}.ds-muted{color:#6b7280;font-size:11.5px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Smart Card — Color",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "색상 코드를 컬러 칩 + RGB 분해로 보여주는 카드. 칩 배경엔 알파 표현용 체커보드.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Color 항목, 클릭하여 복사\"><header class=\"ds-card-head\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-color\">COLOR</span><time class=\"ds-card-date\">방금</time></header><div class=\"ds-card-row\"><span class=\"ds-chip\" style=\"--c:#4f46e5\"></span><div class=\"ds-stack\"><div class=\"ds-strong\">#4f46e5</div><div class=\"ds-muted\">rgb(79, 70, 229)</div></div></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;transition:all .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;color:#111827}.ds-card:hover{border-color:#4f46e5;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -4px rgba(79,70,229,.25);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-badge{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px}.ds-badge-color{background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e}.ds-card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-card-date{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:#6b7280}.ds-card-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13px}.ds-chip{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;position:relative;background-color:var(--c);background-image:linear-gradient(45deg,#f0f0f0 25%,transparent 25%),linear-gradient(-45deg,#f0f0f0 25%,transparent 25%),linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 75%,#f0f0f0 75%),linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 75%,#f0f0f0 75%);background-size:8px 8px;background-position:0 0,0 4px,4px -4px,-4px 0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 32px var(--c)}.ds-stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0;flex:1}.ds-strong{font-weight:600;font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px}.ds-muted{color:#6b7280;font-size:11.5px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Spotlight Modal",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "spotlight-input",
      "description": "Cmd+Shift+V 로 열리는 화면 중앙 모달. 시스템에서 유일한 진짜 입체.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-spot\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-spot-panel\"><input class=\"ds-spot-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"클립보드 검색...\" /><ul class=\"ds-spot-list\" role=\"listbox\"><li class=\"ds-spot-row ds-spot-active\" role=\"option\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-url\">URL</span><span class=\"ds-spot-text\">linear.app/changelog</span></li><li class=\"ds-spot-row\" role=\"option\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-code\">CODE</span><span class=\"ds-spot-text\">const router = useRouter()</span></li></ul><div class=\"ds-spot-hint\"><span><kbd>↑↓</kbd> 선택</span><span><kbd>Enter</kbd> 복사</span><span><kbd>Esc</kbd> 닫기</span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-spot{position:relative;background:rgba(15,23,42,.45);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:32px 0;display:flex;justify-content:center}.ds-spot-panel{width:min(520px,100%);background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0,0,0,.4);overflow:hidden;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;animation:ds-pop-in .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}@keyframes ds-pop-in{from{transform:translateY(-12px) scale(.97);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}.ds-spot-input{width:100%;height:56px;padding:0 22px;border:none;outline:none;background:transparent;color:#111827;font-size:18px;font-family:inherit;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}.ds-spot-input::placeholder{color:#6b7280}.ds-spot-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:6px}.ds-spot-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-spot-row:hover{background:#f3f4f6}.ds-spot-active{background:#eef2ff!important;outline:1px solid #4f46e5}.ds-badge{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;width:60px;text-align:center}.ds-badge-url{background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8}.ds-badge-code{background:#e0e7ff;color:#3730a3}.ds-spot-text{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#111827}.ds-spot-hint{display:flex;gap:16px;padding:8px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;background:#f9fafb;font-size:11px;color:#6b7280}.ds-spot-hint kbd{font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;margin-right:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "수동 추가, 주요 confirm 액션. 한 화면에 한 개 이내.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">+ 추가</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);box-shadow:none}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:#4338ca}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #4f46e5;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Danger Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "전체 삭제 같은 위험 액션. 호버 시에만 채워진다.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-ghost\">전체 삭제</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#ef4444;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:all .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-btn-ghost:hover{background:#ef4444;color:#fff;border-color:#ef4444}.ds-btn-ghost:active{transform:translateY(1px)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Detection Pill (ON)",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "pill-detection-on",
      "description": "자동 복사 감지 ON 상태. Blade Emerald는 의미 전달용 — 데코 아님.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-on\">자동 감지 ON</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{border:1px solid transparent;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;transition:all .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-pill-on{background:#10b981;border-color:#10b981;color:#fff}.ds-pill-on:hover{background:#059669;border-color:#059669}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-search",
      "description": "플로팅 패널 상단 검색. 포커스 시 Indigo 링.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"🔍 검색...\" />",
      "css": ".ds-input-search{width:100%;height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;background:#f9fafb;color:#111827;font-size:13px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;outline:none;transition:border-color .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-input-search:focus{border-color:#4f46e5;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #eef2ff}.ds-input-search::placeholder{color:#6b7280}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Content Type Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-content-type",
      "description": "콘텐츠 종류 라벨. UPPERCASE 9.5px. 색만으로 의미를 전달하지 않도록 텍스트 라벨이 항상 함께.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-badge-row\"><span class=\"ds-badge-ct ds-ct-url\">URL</span><span class=\"ds-badge-ct ds-ct-color\">COLOR</span><span class=\"ds-badge-ct ds-ct-json\">JSON</span><span class=\"ds-badge-ct ds-ct-code\">CODE</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-badge-row{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif}.ds-badge-ct{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px}.ds-ct-url{background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8}.ds-ct-color{background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e}.ds-ct-json{background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b}.ds-ct-code{background:#e0e7ff;color:#3730a3}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Pocketknife",
    "overview": "CopyBoard는 한 손에 쥐는 정밀한 도구다. 평소엔 접혀 있고, 일단 펼치면 모든 날이 제자리에 있다. 칼날(Spotlight)은 빠르고 정확하며, 손잡이(플로팅 패널)는 손에 익는 형태고, 표면(neutral 배경)은 점잖은 가죽 케이스 같은 색을 띤다. 화려하지 않다. 다만 잘 만들어졌고, 만든 사람의 손맛이 느껴진다. 이 시스템은 기업 SaaS 대시보드 클리셰, Material Design 표준 룩, 기존 Chrome 확장 클리셰를 명시적으로 거부한다. AI 슬롭 미감 — 무지개 그라데이션 텍스트, 의미 없는 글래스모피즘, 측면 컬러 스트라이프 — 도 같다.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "키보드가 마우스보다 먼저 도달하는 인터페이스",
